  },
  "notes": "Deeper Meta reporting, GA4 funnel breakdowns, and a Google Tag Manager cleanup that fixes tracking most containers get wrong.",
  "whatsNew": [
    "Meta: see every ad's real destination link and UTM tags at a glance, list the organic posts you're boosting, target individual cities, and pause or activate a whole batch of ads in one step.",
    "Google Analytics: break a funnel down by the details you already collect (quiz step, plan, category) instead of just event totals, so you can finally see where people drop off.",
    "Google Tag Manager: one command finds the tags sending event names Google can't report on, retires triggers wired to nothing, and stages every fix for your review before anything goes live."
  ]
